preen (0.7.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Manage Apps lists Snap apps alongside Flatpak and APT; base snaps are
    protected and snapd absence is silent.
  * Manage Apps shows an "Update available" badge (APT from the cached
    index, Flatpak and Snap from their stores) and Update Selected with
    nothing ticked updates every flagged app.
  * Manage Apps fixes: the desktop scan follows XDG data directories, a
    failed batch dpkg -S query falls back to per-file queries, localized
    Name[locale] entries are preferred, and packages shipping several
    launchers show one row per launcher.
  * Deep Clean gains an "Automatic maintenance" card: a systemd timer
    (daily/weekly/monthly) runs the root-level cleanup tasks on schedule.
  * New Drivers page wrapping ubuntu-drivers with recommended badges,
    Install Selected and Auto Install.
  * Snap, ubuntu-drivers and UFW are reported by --doctor; ufw and
    ubuntu-drivers-common are suggested packages.

 -- Md Moft <mdadeel125@gmail.com>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 01:30:00 +0600

preen (0.6.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Right-click integration: .AppImage files can be opened with Preen to
    install, run, update or remove them; optional "Install with Preen" and
    "Run with Preen" entries in the file manager menu; Preen can be set as
    the default app for .AppImage files.
  * New CLI handlers --appimage-handler, --appimage-run and --deb-handler
    with small single-file dialogs instead of the main window.
  * The AppImages page watches the Downloads folder and notices new
    AppImages automatically.
  * Deep Clean can remove old kernel packages (running kernel and one spare
    are always protected).
  * Optimize System gains a firewall (UFW) toggle that applies immediately.

 -- Preen contributors <64582744+mdadeel@users.noreply.github.com>  Thu, 30 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0600

preen (0.5.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * New AppImages page: install AppImage downloads with a menu entry and
    icon, reinstall over an installed app to update it, and uninstall
    installs Preen created (external setups keep their files).
  * Drag-and-drop: drop .AppImage files anywhere on the window to install
    them, or a .deb to install it with one polkit prompt.
  * Selection fixes: Manage Apps gains Select all/Clear; rows on Install,
    Manage and Deep Clean toggle when clicked; Select all and Clear both
    respect the active search.
  * Refresh all ten GTK pages, Preen-only appearance and bundled icons.
  * Improve cleanup, package, service, backup and diagnostic safeguards.
  * Include privacy, security, licence notices and screenshot documentation.
  * Prepare version-matched source and binary release artifacts.

 -- Preen contributors <64582744+mdadeel@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 29 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0600

preen (0.4.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * macOS-inspired design pass: grouped sidebar sections, segmented source
    control, softer frosted cards, refined typography and status colours.
  * Fix the task runner dropping queued startup reads (boot info, services,
    cleanable scan, snapshots and preferences now always load).
  * Dashboard gains a swap card plus load average; Deep Clean adds the pip
    cache, select-all and a live selected-size counter.
  * Services gains Restart, a running-only filter and result counts.
  * Customize gains desktop text scaling; Optimize gains a swap size choice.
  * Backup lists Timeshift snapshots; Logs gains a text filter.
  * Catalogue grows to 55 curated apps and 6 presets.

